# This project compiles each top-level *.cpp into a Unix executable with the
# same base name and no extension (not *.exe - that's a Windows PE suffix,
# and these are Mach-O binaries from e.g. `g++ playground.cpp -o playground`).
# So instead of listing every binary by name: ignore everything at the root,
# then un-ignore anything that has an extension, plus directories.
/*
!/*.*
!/*/

test.cpp
playground.cpp
tempCodeRunnerFile.cpp

# ...then re-ignore specific dotted files/dirs that are still noise
tempCodeRunnerFile.cpp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Generic C/C++ build output, in case a build system gets added later
*.o
*.obj
*.out
*.exe
*.dSYM/
*.pch
*.gch
*.ilk
*.pdb
build/
out/
cmake-build-*/
